    "detailed_description": "<h1>New DLC Available</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363330/extras/970580b752162f1d0d7c9bbcd04e31b4.avif?t=1749150185\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363330/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1749150185\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363330/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1749150185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363330/extras/bb7d977755b8f598a61a3e70e646889e.avif?t=1749150185\" /></span><br><br>Welcome to Witch World, a puzzle game where you can immerse yourself in a magical world of witches and wizards. Collect beautifully crafted puzzle pieces featuring both wicked witches and benevolent sorceresses, and enjoy the challenge of piecing them together to reveal stunning images.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363330/extras/96644cfb0eba8b3e0e34e16a8ac73e0c.avif?t=1749150185\" /></span><br><br>As you progress through the levels, you'll encounter new and more intricate puzzles that will test your skills and keep you engaged. With a variety of difficulty levels and a wealth of intricate artwork to discover, Witch World offers enjoying of entertainment for puzzle enthusiasts and magic lovers alike.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363330/extras/58005dbbd777bf30a2f5cdced91a081d.avif?t=1749150185\" /></span><br><br>So take a break from the ordinary and dive into a world of sorcery and intrigue with Witch World. Collect, piece together, and unravel the mysteries of this bewitching puzzle game today! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363330/extras/6001f6fb5867b3d0b54014d7c07d7a22.avif?t=1749150185\" /></span><br><br>Let the enchanting images and challenging puzzles bewitch you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Cute witch and wizard girls<br></li><li> Tips<br></li><li> Puzzles<br></li><li> Relaxing music<br></li><li> Useful hotkeys</li></ul>",
